   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Public Health Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at empowering communities in Tanzania to prevent alcohol-related harm and reduce violence against women and children by 10%. Through evidence-based advocacy and community mobilisation, TPHO supports a ministry-endorsed draft National Alcohol Policy and adoption of local by-laws in four wards. Activities include training 200 duty bearers in enforcement, strengthening community and school groups, and helping 120 vulnerable households shift to sustainable livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
